  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1962-p26.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Completing the square, \\[ 8x-3x^2 =\\frac{16}{3}-3\\left(x-\\frac43\\right)^2. \\] The square term is nonnegative, so the maximum is \\(\\frac{16}{3}.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
